From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Omit S22 otapreopt_slot allow on pinned A376B policy

Reason: attempt45 policy gate: plat_sepolicy.cil:78269 fails to resolve
(allow otapreopt_slot vendor_apex_file (dir (search))). Active split-policy
symbol audit finds this is the only allow source/target without a declaration.
AZH4 has no otapreopt_slot domain. Do not invent a domain or loosen enforcement.
Files: existing finalization/customize.sh embedded SELinux compatibility helper.
After applying existing rule blocks, remove only this exact S22 allow for
A376B source; reject changed declaration or unexpected rule count. Keep all
other rules and the mandatory complete secilc gate; other donors unchanged.
Verification: active split symbol audit, actual helper, full staged policy
compilation, source replay and original fork package/release gates. Runtime
SELinux behavior still requires device logs. Kernel unchanged.

---
--- a/unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_finalization/customize.sh
+++ b/unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_finalization/customize.sh
@@ -3123,6 +3123,19 @@
 append_unique(vendor_cil, quoted_block('local SUPPLEMENTARY_RULES="'))
 append_unique(plat_cil, quoted_block('local PLAT_PERMISSIVE_RULES="'))
 append_unique(plat_cil, heredoc_block("<<'ENFORCING_ALLOW_RULES_EOF'"))
+
+# This S22 domain is absent from the pinned AZH4 split policy. Keep all
+# other compatibility rules and compile the entire policy afterwards.
+import os, re
+if os.environ.get("ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG") == "essi_a376b_android16":
+    rule = "(allow otapreopt_slot vendor_apex_file (dir (search)))"
+    text = plat_cil.read_text()
+    if re.search(r"\(type(?:attribute)?\s+otapreopt_slot\s*\)", text + vendor_cil.read_text()):
+        raise SystemExit("AZH4 otapreopt_slot declaration changed; review compatibility rule")
+    if text.splitlines().count(rule) != 1:
+        raise SystemExit("Unexpected obsolete otapreopt_slot rule count")
+    plat_cil.write_text(text.replace(rule + "\n", ""))
+    print("M2: omitted one S22 allow for absent otapreopt_slot domain")
 PY
 }
 
